<title>USA: Newfield buys oil, natgas interests for $43 mln.</title>
<headline>Newfield buys oil, natgas interests for $43 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newfield Exploration Co said on Wednesday that it bought interests in five oil and natural gas offshore producing fields in the Gulf of Mexico for $43 million.</p>
<p>These acquisitions have a combined natural gas production rate of 18 million cubic feet per day. The purchases should boost Newfield's average daily net production 10 percent, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>The purchase was funded through Newfield's revolving credit facility.</p>
